<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Skandagupta</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 455–467 CE</span> · <a href="/centuries/5th-century">5th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Skandagupta was an emperor of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gupta-empire">Gupta Empire</a> who reigned c. 455–467 CE. He repelled an early major incursion of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/huna-people">Hunas</a>, commemorated in his inscriptions. Continuous frontier warfare drained the empire's resources after his reign.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/skandagupta.jpg" alt="Skandagupta" width="320" height="160" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: CNG Coins · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skandagupta_Circa_455-480_CE.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
